WEBVTT

00:05:30.743 --> 00:05:34.121
It's a really slow sport,
requires a lot of yoga.

00:05:34.121 --> 00:05:36.332
(Laughter)

00:05:36.374 --> 00:05:37.833
But it is more fun than golf.

00:05:38.667 --> 00:05:40.544
So.

00:05:40.544 --> 00:05:42.171
It was there in that garage

00:05:42.213 --> 00:05:46.175
that I learned the key to why all our kids
see with childlike wonder.

00:05:46.967 --> 00:05:48.928
It's because they don't have assumptions.

00:05:48.969 --> 00:05:51.138
They don't have assumptions
about the box yet.

00:05:51.138 --> 00:05:53.349
They haven't been told
what it's supposed to do

00:05:53.391 --> 00:05:55.184
or what it's supposed to be used for.

00:05:55.184 --> 00:05:57.645
Therefore, they have
all these other possibilities.

00:05:58.062 --> 00:05:59.814
So for you and I,

00:05:59.814 --> 00:06:02.983
as we approach life
and try to solve new problems,